<title>USA: Lomak to buy $400 mln of oil, gas assets.</title>
<headline>Lomak to buy $400 mln of oil, gas assets.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, TEX. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lomak Petroleum Inc said it agreed to buy oil and gas properties from units of American Cometra Inc for $370 million in cash and $30 million in common stock.</p>
<p>The properties' assets include 515 producing wells, 401 proven development projects, exploration rights on about 149,000 gross acres and 265 miles of gas pipelines, the company said.</p>
<p>The properties produce about 51,100 mcf of gas a day and 2,100 barrels of oil and natural gas liquids a day, the company said.</p>
</text>
